Hello World (the RCSNUSP sample):
    /++++!/===========?\>++.>+.+++++++..+++\
    \+++\ | /+>+++++++>/ /++++++++++<<.++>./
    $+++/ | \+++++++++>\ \+++++.>.+++.-----\
          \==-<<<<+>+++/ /=.>.+>.--------.-/
  it prints:
    Hello World!

Two loops (Core SNUSP):
    $++++++!/>++++++++<-?\=++++++++++!/>.+<-?\=>>++++++++++.
            \============/            \======/
  it prints:
    0123456789

Echo twice (Modular SNUSP):
           /==!/======ECHO==,==.==#
           |   |
    $==>==@/==@/==<==#
  given Hi, it prints:
    Hi

Three calls (Modular SNUSP):
                                /==!/==!/==PRINT==.+==#
                                |   |   |
    $+++++++++++++!/>+++++<-?\>@/==@/==@/==<++++++++++.#
                   \=========/
  it prints:
    ABC
